@page "/hosts"

<PageTitle>Host a house concert - GigHaus</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="What it takes to host a house concert, and how GigHaus helps with the show page, guest list, privacy and check-in. Free for hosts." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="mk-page-head">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-page-head__grid">
        <div>
            <p class="mk-kicker">For hosts</p>
            <h1>You don't need a stage. You need a room and a few chairs.</h1>
            <p class="mk-lead">
                Hosts are the heart of GigHaus. A living room, a barn, a backyard or a basement all count
                if there's space for people to sit and listen.
            </p>
            <a class="mk-btn" href="signup">Sign up your venue</a>
        </div>
        <Mascot Size="320" />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section">
    <div class="mk-wrap">
        <h2>What you do, and what GigHaus does.</h2>
        <div class="mk-split">
            <div class="mk-card">
                <h3>You</h3>
                <ul class="mk-list">
                    <li>Book an artist you'd love to hear</li>
                    <li>Set the date and how many guests you're comfortable with</li>
                    <li>Choose a suggested donation</li>
                    <li>Invite people and share your show link</li>
                    <li>Open the door and enjoy the evening</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="mk-card mk-card--gold">
                <h3>GigHaus</h3>
                <ul class="mk-list">
                    <li>Gives you a page for each show</li>
                    <li>Collects reservations in one guest list</li>
                    <li>Stops reservations when the room is full</li>
                    <li>Emails your address to confirmed guests only</li>
                    <li>Gives you check-in at the door</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section mk-section--cream">
    <div class="mk-wrap">
        <h2>Built for a private home.</h2>
        <div class="mk-cards mk-cards--three">
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>Your address, your call</h3>
                <p>The public show page says which city you're in and nothing more. Only confirmed guests get the street address.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>Your limit, respected</h3>
                <p>Set a guest limit for each show. When it's reached, the show page stops taking reservations.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>Clear about money</h3>
                <p>Offer a suggested donation or set a minimum. Either way, guests see exactly what's expected before they reserve.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section mk-section--gold">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-closer">
        <Mascot Size="192" />
        <div>
            <h2>Not sure your space is right?</h2>
            <p class="mk-lead">Tell us about it. We'll give you an honest answer and help you plan your first show.</p>
            <a class="mk-btn mk-btn--navy" href="contact">Talk to us</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
